{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30584","headline":"和主司王起 · 高退之","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年桃李已滋荣，今日兰荪又发生。\n葑菲采时皆有道，权衡分处且无情。\n叨陪鸳鹭朝天客，共作门阑出谷鸎。\n何事感恩偏觉重，忽闻金榜扣柴荆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高退之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}